<title>USA: University of Missouri Health System $136 mln.</title>
<headline>University of Missouri Health System $136 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced a $136 million health facilities revenue bond issue for the Curators of the University of Missouri for the University of Missouri Health System, Series 1996A, with a top yield of 5.72 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC insured.  </p>
